DCR01 *  MAR 10, 2005  D.RAUCH       DCR01    REQUEST# 2005-78515
DCR01 *     DISPLAY FILE PROCESSING CHANGED FROM USING ZCSISINQ
DCR01 *     NEW DISPLAY FILE ZSEADPTIQ CREATED - FORMATS COPIED
DCR01 *     FROM ZCSISINQ.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------
DCR01 *  MMM DD, CCYY  XXNAMEXX      XXX01    REQUEST# 2005-XXXXX
DCR01 *****************************************************************
001300 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
001400 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
001500 SOURCE-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
001600 OBJECT-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
       SPECIAL-NAMES. I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
DCR01             ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZSEADPTIQ-SI
                  ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
                  ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
                  FILE STATUS IS DISPLAY-STATUS
                  CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.

           SELECT MVALIDPLT-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS1701
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                    ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

002000     SELECT SORT-FILE ASSIGN TO DISK-SORT.
002100     SELECT DPT-FILE ASSIGN TO DISK-DEADPTIQ.
002200
002300 DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  DISPLAY-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DISPLAY-REC        PIC X(2000).

       FD  MVALIDPLT-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MVALIDPLT-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS1700  OF MCFLCS1701.

002500 FD  DPT-FILE.
002600 01  DPT-REC.
002700     05  DP-REQ-DEPT               PIC X(4).
002800     05  DP-CHARGE-DEPT            PIC X(4).
002900     05  DP-FLAG                   PIC X(1).
003000
003100 SD  SORT-FILE.
003200 01  SORT-REC.
003300     05  SORT-REQ-DEPT             PIC X(4).
003400     05  SORT-CHARGE-DEPT          PIC X(4).
003500     05  SORT-FLAG                 PIC X(1).
003600
003700 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
003800
003900 77  SUB                           PIC S9(4) COMP-4 VALUE 0.
004000 77  SUB1                          PIC S9(4) COMP-4 VALUE 0.
004100 77  SUB2                          PIC S9(4) COMP-4 VALUE 0.
004200 77  SWITCH-FLAG                   PIC X(1)  VALUE SPACES.
004300 77  END-OF-DPTS-FLAG              PIC X(1)  VALUE SPACES.
004400
