006100
006200 01  MESSAGE-BUFFER.
006300     05  MSG-TEXT.
               10  MESSAGE-BUFFER-1 PIC X(1).
               10  FILLER           PIC X(67).
006400     05  MSG-FLD          PIC X(8)   VALUE SPACES.
006500     05  MSG-FLD-9 REDEFINES MSG-FLD PIC ZZZZZZZ9.
006600
