008400 01  DSET-NAMES.
008500     05  DSET-MVALIDPLT      PIC X(16) VALUE "MVALIDPLTDATA;".
008600
008700 01  MODE-AREA.
008800     05  MODE2                     PIC S9(4)   COMP       VALUE 2.
008900     05  MODE3                     PIC S9(4)   COMP       VALUE 3.
009000     05  MODE7                     PIC S9(4)   COMP       VALUE 7.
009100
009200 01  ALL-ITEMS                     PIC X(2)  VALUE "@;".
009300
009400 01  PLTDATA-ARG.
009500     10  PLTDATA-ARG-1-2           PIC X(2).
009600     10  PLTDATA-ARG-3-10.
009700         15  PLTDATA-REQ-DEPT      PIC X(4).
009800         15  PLTDATA-CHARGE-DEPT   PIC X(4).
009900
