011200**                                                          **
011300**************************************************************
011400
011500 01  DE-FIELDS.
011600     05  V-DEPT-LINE OCCURS 18 TIMES.
011700         10  V-REQ-DEPT            PIC X(4).
011800         10  V-CHARGE-DEPT         PIC X(4).
011900         10  V-FLAG                PIC X(1).
           05  DE-COMMAND-LINE           PIC X(79).
           05  DE-MESSAGE-LINE           PIC X(79).
012000
012100 01  SAVE-DEPT-LINE               PIC X(41).
012200
